    "INVERSE relationship: rates up -> prices down; rates down -> prices up.",
    "Premium = coupon higher than market rates; discount = coupon lower than market rates.",
    "Current Yield = annual interest dollars / current market price.",
    "DISCOUNT bond ranking: Nominal < Current < YTC < YTM. PREMIUM bond ranking reverses: YTM < YTC < Current < Nominal.",
