       "type": "text",
       "html": "<p><strong>Subordinated debentures</strong> rank <em>behind</em> regular debentures and other general creditors. Because their claim is junior, they pay the <strong>highest yield</strong> among an issuer's straight debt, and they are frequently made convertible to sweeten the deal.</p>"
