        "K-12 tuition up to $10,000 per beneficiary per year (raised to $20,000 beginning in 2026).",
        "Registered apprenticeship program costs, plus up to $10,000 lifetime of student loan repayment per beneficiary.",
        "Under SECURE 2.0, up to $35,000 lifetime may be rolled into the beneficiary's Roth IRA if the account is at least 15 years old."
