       "title": "5-Year Gift 'Superfunding'",
       "text": "Contributions to a 529 are completed gifts to the beneficiary, so they use the annual gift-tax exclusion. A donor may front-load FIVE years of exclusions at once per beneficiary without gift tax, provided no further gifts are made to that beneficiary during the five-year window."
