       "type": "text",
       "html": "<p>A bond paying a fixed 3% loses ground if inflation runs 5%. The most exposed holdings are <strong>long-term fixed-rate bonds, fixed annuities, and cash</strong> — and the most exposed investors are retirees living on a fixed income.</p>"
